PopupAndWait
	Also known as: FmPopupAndWait
	
	Synopsis:
	        String FmPopupAndWait( Widget w )
	
	Description:
	
	Pops up the widget w and the program enters a local event-handling loop, until
	the Return function is called. The program then exits the local loop, and
	returns the value passed as an argument to Return. If the popup flag is set in
	the Resources Box, the shell grabs all events, thus forcing the user to answer
